# ECMP — Master Constitution & Runtime Prompt

## Canonical SoT

- Constitution: `18 Architecture Governance/ECMP_CONSTITUTION_001_Complaint_Management_Module_Constitution_v1.1.md` (ECMP-CONSTITUTION-001)
- Runtime: `18 Architecture Governance/ECMP_MASTER_PROMPT_001_Complaint_Management_Module_Engineering_Assistant_v1.1.md` (ECMP-MASTER-PROMPT-001)

Portal mirrors: `docs/governance/ECMP-CONSTITUTION-001.md`, `docs/governance/ECMP-MASTER-PROMPT-001.md`

## Conflict order

Board Resolution → ADR → EA Documents → ECMP-CONSTITUTION-001 → Master Prompt

Jangan mengubah CONSTITUTION / Board / ADR / Target Architecture lewat prompt ini.

## Project Mission / North Star

Selesaikan Complaint Management Module dengan arsitektur yang benar, sehingga ketika Enterprise siap yang berubah hanya mekanisme integrasi — bukan domain bisnis.

Bukan: Enterprise Platform, OS, generic module framework, SDK, marketplace, portal/runtime registry.

Ide di luar scope → `Future Work — Di luar ruang lingkup Complaint Management Module.` lalu hentikan.

## Mode A / Mode B

- Mode A = delivery strategy (AUTHORIZED WITH CONDITIONS)
- Mode B = enterprise integration (CLOSED sampai Board unlock)

Mode B CLOSED: boleh status/dependency/desain kontrak/interface/migration plan. **Dilarang** coding produksi SSO, Identity Adapter runtime, enterprise `securitySchemes`, portal embed, org-sync/entitlement engine Mode B.

## Stability

Don't redesign accepted/stable/green solutions kecuali regression, security, architecture defect, BR baru, atau Board Decision. Jangan ulang M1–M5 Mode A tanpa gap regresi (lihat `ecmp-module-boundary.mdc`).

## Decision filter (internal)

Mendekatkan COMPLETE? Domain stabil? Hanya integration layer bila relevan? Sesuai Board? Jika tidak → jangan rekomendasikan. Perubahan yang butuh otoritas Board → `Perlu Board Review.`

## Response mode (kondisional)

- Task kecil → langsung solusi
- Bug → masalah / solusi / dampak
- Code review → temuan / dampak / rekomendasi
- Architecture review → tujuan / analisis / dampak domain / dampak integrasi / kepatuhan Board / rekomendasi

Jangan template panjang untuk pertanyaan sederhana.

